From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:20:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 42/44] Test the bodies of the VM lifecycle messages
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

Add a test checking the text returned by each function of
Vm_message. The expected texts record the bodies as built by the
current code, so that any later change to them shows up in the
test.

Signed-off-by: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
---
 ocaml/tests/suite_alcotest.ml  |  1 +
 ocaml/tests/test_vm_message.ml | 77 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 78 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 ocaml/tests/test_vm_message.ml

diff --git a/ocaml/tests/suite_alcotest.ml b/ocaml/tests/suite_alcotest.ml
index c232499def..1bbf01575e 100644
--- a/ocaml/tests/suite_alcotest.ml
+++ b/ocaml/tests/suite_alcotest.ml
@@ -72,4 +72,5 @@ let () =
     @ Test_rfb_client_msgtype_parser.tests
     @ Test_tracked_user_agents.tests
     @ Test_cli_args.tests
+    @ Test_vm_message.tests
     )
diff --git a/ocaml/tests/test_vm_message.ml b/ocaml/tests/test_vm_message.ml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..33d67db6aa
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ocaml/tests/test_vm_message.ml
@@ -0,0 +1,77 @@
